WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Subtasks. Break a task into smaller tasks, up to four levels deep.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: onboarding; launch plan.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:27.850
Break a task down: type a subtask and press Enter.

4
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:31.490
Each subtask is a full task — open it…

5
00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.380
…and the breadcrumb leads back up.

6
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:41.980
Rows show progress as done/total.

7
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:47.980
Add subtask is refused: The task is already four levels deep.

8
00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:52.480
Real tasks, not checkboxes
